{"additions":2,"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"Release v0.9.0\n\n## Changes since v0.8.0\n- ✨ GitHub polling: rate-limit detection with exponential backoff, a status-bar warning, and a configurable `github-poll-interval` (#135, #137)\n- ✨ Repository-local personal config `.vig.kdl` with a trust dialog for tracked files, `repo-config` kill switch and `vig config trust` (#132, #138)\n- ✨ Pin the Projects board with `projects-board` (#131, #134)\n- 📖 User guide (Getting Started + all views, English and Japanese) published on GitHub Pages: https://td72.github.io/vig/ (#136, #139)\n- ⚡ `o` opens issues / PRs in the browser without an API request (#141)\n- 📝 Repositioned as a read-only TUI cockpit for busy repositories — new descriptions everywhere, including the crate description that lands on crates.io with this release (#142)\n\nMerging this PR triggers the release workflow (tag → GitHub Release → crates.io publish → binaries → Homebrew formula).\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01TreGn5Xh4PjDRv9Yo4QU4w\n","changedFiles":2,"comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-08-31T08:52:36Z","deletions":2,"headRefName":"release/0.9.0","labels":[],"number":143,"reviewDecision":"","reviews":[{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABLeEFNw","author":{"login":"copilot-pull-request-reviewer"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"### 🟢 Approval recommended\n\nThe changes are a straightforward, internally consistent version bump in the manifest and lockfile with no functional code impact.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Pull request overview</summary>\n\nRelease prep for `vig` v0.9.0 by updating the crate version metadata so the repository and publish pipeline reflect the new release.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Bumped crate version from `0.8.0` → `0.9.0` in `Cargo.toml`.\n- Updated the `vig` package entry in `Cargo.lock` to `0.9.0`.\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>File summaries</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| Cargo.toml | Updates the crate version to `0.9.0` for the release. |\r\n| Cargo.lock | Keeps the lockfile’s `vig` package entry in sync with the new version. |\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>Review details</summary>\n\n- **Files reviewed:** 1/2 changed files\n- **Comments generated:** 0\n- **Review effort level:** Lite\n</details>\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/td72/vig/new/main?filename=.github/skills/code-review/SKILL.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add a `code-review` agent skill</a> or configure MCP servers for context-aware, tailored reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/copilot/how-tos/use-copilot-agents/request-a-code-review/use-code-review?tool=webui#mcp-servers-and-agent-skills\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn more in the docs.</a>","submittedAt":"2026-08-31T08:54:23Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"aa6e041bc78c0171ad199fe78b85b9e16a3ce515"}}],"state":"MERGED","statusCheckRollup":[{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-08-31T08:56:08Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/33374949491/job/99434231614","name":"build (x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-latest)","startedAt":"2026-08-31T08:52:42Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-08-31T08:53:21Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/33374949512/job/99434231629","name":"lint","startedAt":"2026-08-31T08:52:42Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-08-31T09:02:55Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/33375729468/job/99436666719","name":"create-tag","startedAt":"2026-08-31T09:02:45Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Release"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-08-31T08:5